<h2 class="wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold">Everything Bagel Buns</h2>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
<span class="wprm-recipe-details wprm-recipe-author wprm-block-text-light">Emily &#8211; My Messy Kitchen</span>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
<div class="wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal"><span style="display: block;">These Everything Bagel Buns are a fun take on the classic bagel and cream cheese! Easy to put together the night before and bake up in the morning, and made with simple, affordable ingredients!</span></div>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
