				<li class="comment even thread-even depth-1" id="comment-47">
				<div id="div-comment-47" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Cheryl Batone</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/everything-bagel-buns/#comment-47">August 26, 2020 at 6:13 pm</a>		</div>

		<p><img class="wprm-comment-rating" src="https://mymessykitchenn.com/wp-content/plugins/wp-recipe-maker/assets/icons/rating/stars-alt-5.svg" alt="5 stars" width="80" height="16" /><br />
Was looking for a good bagel recipe and stumbled upon your site.  These are sooooooo good!  Thanks for sharing Emily!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-47" data-commentid="47" data-postid="1369" data-belowelement="div-comment-47" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Cheryl Batone" aria-label="Reply to Cheryl Batone">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment odd alt thread-odd thread-alt depth-1 parent" id="comment-2372">
				<div id="div-comment-2372" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Laura BT</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/everything-bagel-buns/#comment-2372">August 13, 2022 at 8:48 am</a>		</div>

		<p><img class="wprm-comment-rating" src="https://mymessykitchenn.com/wp-content/plugins/wp-recipe-maker/assets/icons/rating/stars-alt-5.svg" alt="5 stars" width="80" height="16" /><br />
These are UNREAL and a must-have for guests or a brunch! Literally, I’ve learned these are everyone’s favorite at a brunch. I love how easy these are to make. Most important thing is to let the dough rise enough and they come out perfect every time.</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-2372" data-commentid="2372" data-postid="1369" data-belowelement="div-comment-2372" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Laura BT" aria-label="Reply to Laura BT">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-admin bypostauthor even depth-2" id="comment-2375">
				<div id="div-comment-2375" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Emily</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/everything-bagel-buns/#comment-2375">August 14, 2022 at 2:04 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>So happy you love them! 🙂</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-2375" data-commentid="2375" data-postid="1369" data-belowelement="div-comment-2375" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Emily" aria-label="Reply to Emily">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment odd alt thread-even depth-1" id="comment-2483">
				<div id="div-comment-2483" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Claire gress</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/everything-bagel-buns/#comment-2483">March 22, 2023 at 5:25 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>How long can they last in the fridge before baking? I want to make these but for one person I won’t eat them all in one morning</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-2483" data-commentid="2483" data-postid="1369" data-belowelement="div-comment-2483" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Claire gress" aria-label="Reply to Claire gress">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-odd thread-alt depth-1" id="comment-2502">
				<div id="div-comment-2502" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Molly</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/everything-bagel-buns/#comment-2502">May 5, 2023 at 6:35 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Can’t wait to try these! Question: if you are prepping in advance, any reason why you can also season them in advance so they’re totally ready to rise/bake with no extra steps?</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-2502" data-commentid="2502" data-postid="1369" data-belowelement="div-comment-2502" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Molly" aria-label="Reply to Molly">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment odd alt thread-even depth-1" id="comment-2512">
				<div id="div-comment-2512" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Nicole</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/everything-bagel-buns/#comment-2512">June 1, 2023 at 5:14 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Could you have a dipping sauce with these? What do you think would pair well?</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-2512" data-commentid="2512" data-postid="1369" data-belowelement="div-comment-2512" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Nicole" aria-label="Reply to Nicole">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="pingback even thread-odd thread-alt depth-1" id="comment-2614">
				<div id="div-comment-2614" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn"><a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/buffalo-chicken-bombs/" class="url" rel="ugc">Buffalo Chicken Bombs - My Messy Kitchen</a></cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/everything-bagel-buns/#comment-2614">September 5, 2023 at 3:18 am</a>		</div>

		<p>[&#8230;] You all have loved my other recipes where we stuff dinner rolls with deliciousness (like these Everything Bagel Bites or Cheesy Pesto Buns) so I figured let&#8217;s stuff this classic dip into dinner rolls and see [&#8230;]</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-2614" data-commentid="2614" data-postid="1369" data-belowelement="div-comment-2614" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Buffalo Chicken Bombs - My Messy Kitchen" aria-label="Reply to Buffalo Chicken Bombs - My Messy Kitchen">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment odd alt thread-even depth-1 parent" id="comment-2686">
				<div id="div-comment-2686" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Diana</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/everything-bagel-buns/#comment-2686">October 25, 2023 at 8:29 pm</a>		</div>

		<p><img class="wprm-comment-rating" src="https://mymessykitchenn.com/wp-content/plugins/wp-recipe-maker/assets/icons/rating/stars-alt-5.svg" alt="5 stars" width="80" height="16" /><br />
These are going on my must make list. I’m thinking I could also fill with a bit of marinara, a small, cooked meatball and some grated mozzarella, then serve marinara for dipping.</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-2686" data-commentid="2686" data-postid="1369" data-belowelement="div-comment-2686" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Diana" aria-label="Reply to Diana">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
