			<a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/everything-bagel-buns/#comment-2741">December 7, 2023 at 7:34 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Ohhh yes love that idea!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-2741" data-commentid="2741" data-postid="1369" data-belowelement="div-comment-2741" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Emily" aria-label="Reply to Emily">Reply</a></div>
