				<div id="div-comment-7595" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Laura R.</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/everything-bagel-buns/#comment-7595">September 2, 2025 at 2:17 am</a>		</div>

		<p><img class="wprm-comment-rating" src="https://mymessykitchenn.com/wp-content/plugins/wp-recipe-maker/assets/icons/rating/stars-alt-5.svg" alt="5 stars" width="80" height="16" /><br />
So easy to make, and so delicious. I&#8221;ve made them a few times now, and they are ALWAYS a hit.</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-7595" data-commentid="7595" data-postid="1369" data-belowelement="div-comment-7595" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Laura R." aria-label="Reply to Laura R.">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-even depth-1" id="comment-10302">
				<div id="div-comment-10302" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn"><a href="https://vidglory.com/" class="url" rel="ugc external nofollow">Marcus Chen</a></cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://mymessykitchenn.com/everything-bagel-buns/#comment-10302">June 17, 2026 at 11:15 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Everything bagel seasoning is one of those things that makes everything better! I have been putting it on everything from eggs to avocado toast. These buns look absolutely gorgeous and I bet the flavor is incredible. Making them at home instead of buying store-bought is such a satisfying feeling. Love this recipe!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-10302" data-commentid="10302" data-postid="1369" data-belowelement="div-comment-10302" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Marcus Chen" aria-label="Reply to Marcus Chen">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
